{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:703","content":{"id":703,"title":"搜索旋转排序数组II","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a18e02ce-abb5-40f7-837b-20a098ed59e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a40896ec-e282-4b34-a57e-a2a8535f7d24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"已知存在一个按非降序排列的整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，数组中的值不必互不相同。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9035cb0-d8bf-4db5-a193-2ff351e86a92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在传递给函数之前，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在预先未知的某个下标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"k(0 <= k < nums.length)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"上进行了 旋转 ，使数组变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[nums[k], nums[k+1], ..., nums[n-1], nums[0], nums[1], ..., nums[k-1]]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（下标 从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始 计数）。例如，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[0,1,2,4,4,4,5,6,6,7]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在下标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处经旋转后可能变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[4,5,6,6,7,0,1,2,4,4]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf6835b6-2b1d-4bc4-aad1-22019471a128","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你旋转后的数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和一个整数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你编写一个函数来判断给定的目标值是否存在于数组中。如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中存在这个目标值 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06a98ac6-c85f-4ad3-8174-39fba0b93287","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"2bfcdd7b-f3b9-4ccf-81b7-5c825cfe929b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fe44d204-d08d-49de-9e6e-e69bb3471492","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [2,5,6,0,0,1,2], target = 0\n输出：true","collabId":"78af83db-c897-43a6-b797-6f1289e7853e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fa052bc7-6426-4f3d-99f8-06ce7c1dcfdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"17045b07-225f-444f-959a-455120ba1bef","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"424e354c-ede1-4723-ad96-9210054381d5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [2,5,6,0,0,1,2], target = 3\n输出：false","collabId":"c769d3bc-1b87-45b5-8d06-f95529665152","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"692f128d-55af-4e98-8bcf-2845094f96b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbe3efd4-6723-4ab5-a024-d084183e294a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"旋转数组的概念上面介绍的很清晰了，因为数组原来是有序的，所以我们本能的会想到使用二分搜索法去进行搜索，使用二分搜索法可以直接消灭掉一半的搜索范围，但是这个数组经过旋转后，它变得不是有序的了，这为我们使用二分搜索法带来了不便。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30907724-3740-4dcd-8d73-248256c1447a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了使用二分搜索法，我们来看旋转数组的一个性质，随意的将旋转数组分为两部分，其中一部分必然是有序的"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II_e9051db2-77b7-4237-8cd5-48649cb3a271.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II_e9051db2-77b7-4237-8cd5-48649cb3a271.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"e2ee21fd-1dcd-4aef-ac05-fa2acbb493c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc0bdc7f-8e38-407e-b23e-ca5c408d7fab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们只需要判断 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是否在有序的那一部分中即可，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在有序的那一部分中，那么我们就可以扔掉无序的那一部分，如果不在有序的那一部分，则我们就扔掉有序的部分，在无序的部分中寻找，无论怎样我们都可以消灭一半的搜索范围"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II-%E7%AC%AC%202%20%E9%A1%B5_086859fd-96b1-4e0e-a66b-20affc6bdbc1.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II-%E7%AC%AC%202%20%E9%A1%B5_086859fd-96b1-4e0e-a66b-20affc6bdbc1.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"07349f4d-8364-4342-8514-127c14a4b0ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d2f0eb18-ed5e-455c-9b69-c949c51bea75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里你可能会说，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[mid] == nums[start]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的情况呢? 这个时候其实我们不能判断那边是有序的"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II-%E7%AC%AC%203%20%E9%A1%B5_e812efc8-97d0-47ed-9b09-09242e4eab6c.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84II-%E7%AC%AC%203%20%E9%A1%B5_e812efc8-97d0-47ed-9b09-09242e4eab6c.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8ecfeb3a-2202-4ba0-b4ff-7fb3e64a1717","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76e90ee4-bc5e-47e7-a2a8-884a74198d7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个时候我们就不能使用二分搜索了，只能暴力搜索了。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"7680c561-41b3-4d1c-9c19-c4f897b282f8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ea66ef0d-7a3e-4e57-a780-a4887dd75816","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public boolean search(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int start = 0;\n    int end = nums.length - 1;\n\n    while (start <= end) {\n        int mid = start + (end - start) / 2;\n        if (nums[mid] == target) {\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        if (nums[start] == nums[mid]) {\n            start++;\n        }\n\n        if (nums[mid] > nums[start]) {\n            if (target >= nums[start] && target < nums[mid]) {\n                end = mid - 1;\n            } else {\n                start = mid + 1;\n            }\n        } else {\n            if (target > nums[mid] && target <= nums[end]) {\n                start = mid + 1;\n            } else {\n                end = mid - 1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return false;\n}","collabId":"cd195033-554c-4537-a1b3-646d2be49f28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e4d349a5-8681-4b3f-9b13-da1e9f444d9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a5eeb481-06a9-4a71-a38b-1722aec20168","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8447ad58-09a6-4fac-bce5-5a56372f93aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e133fd2b-316d-4d2a-a0b8-f768a5cfb336","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/search-in-rotated-sorted-array-ii/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"be84cf95-b62f-46b5-9f36-f216648bd827","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"搜索旋转排序数组 II"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"39bb651b-c05c-4b20-b9c9-d7e1ed73e4bb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b7bd6df-2072-4e4f-a6b3-67b739bd92e0","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/search-in-rotated-sorted-array-ii/solution/zai-javazhong-ji-bai-liao-100de-yong-hu-by-reedfan/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"2bf89803-075e-4946-9006-b0265bb70d24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"搜索旋转排序数组 II 题解"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"搜索旋转排序数组II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:703","type":"doc","id":703}}],"prevPage":{"title":"盛水最多的容器","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:702","type":"doc","id":702}},"nextPage":{"title":"外观数列","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:705","type":"doc","id":705}},"createTime":1729001642611,"updateTime":1762957756705,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1762957756705}}